          "expr": "increase(home_plug_energy_kwh{plug=~\"$plug\",job=~\"$job\"}[24h])",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "title": "Energy today (24h)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "increase() over a fixed 24h window. Telegraf exposes this series as untyped (no # TYPE counter), so increase()/rate() assume monotonicity; a device power-cycle or z2m restart can show a reset spike. History for this exporter only starts 2026-10-06, so today's value is partial until a full day has accumulated."
    },
