      "title": "Voltage",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "home_plug_voltage_volt (V), last sample in 10m. EU nominal 230V +/-10% = 207-253V. CAVEAT: this series also carries the mV battery voltage of 4 non-plug Zigbee devices (dimmer_sploinky, ir_bedroom, ir_living, ir_sploink), so never aggregate this metric without filtering plug=~\"priza_.*\"."
