      "description": "Availability proxy — no per-plug online/state metric exists. The exporter is scraped every 30s, so a healthy plug yields 10 samples per 5m. 0 (or 'no data') means the plug stopped publishing (e.g. priza_g went silent at 14:29 on 2026-10-06)."
